OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fduring Tuesday morning clears to a
OL,7,Ffine, if a little breezy afternoon.
OL,8,FCloudy but mostly dry on Wednesday and
OL,9,FThursday but fresh to strong winds
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Temperatures above average.
